The <ansi fg="command">Chrysalis Regeneration</ansi> spell infuses the target with deep Chrysalis
energy that dramatically accelerates the body's natural healing. The
target recovers from wounds at a remarkable rate for the duration.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast chrysalis-regeneration [target]</ansi>

